  Text:
    m_Untranslated: 'After adding a new room, you must update the <b>NavMeshSurface</b>,
      which represents the walkable area of your game.


      The new Room_Altar
      GameObject adds new, walkable surface to the NavMesh that you must <b>bake</b>
      into the existing NavMesh surface.'
